    "enterreviewmodeimmediately": true,
    "allowrevealanswer": false,
    "intro": "<p>One question. Try 0.4, then 0.16, 0.8 and 2 in turn. Two things to watch: does the right MARKER appear for each, and does a wrong value score 1 mark?</p>",
